{tu'e tu'u} structure will help.

http://mw.lojban.org/extensions/ilmentufa/camxes.html

bare {i SUMTCITA bo}:
([broda VAU] [i ca bo {brode VAU} {i <te zu'e> bo <brodo VAU>}])

with {tu'e tu'u}:
([tu'e {<broda VAU> <i ca bo (=C2=B9brode VAU=C2=B9)>} tu'u] [i {te zu'e} b=
o {brodo=20
VAU}])


iku'i e'uru'e=20
I would rather simply add "jo'au zantufa xi pire", because this parser=20
supports left-association of BO (though {ku} or {cu} become necessary after=
=20
{la CMEVLA} because it supports also cmevla as tanru unit):

http://guskant.github.io/gerna_cipra/zantufa-0.2.html

([CU {broda VAU}] [i ca bo {CU <brode VAU>}] [i {te zu'e} bo {CU <brodo=20
VAU>}])
